<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="center col">
      <view class="brand">毛发专病医联体</view>
      <view class="t-sm t-sub mt-8">{{role === 'doctor' ? '医生端 · 实名认证入驻' : '患者端 · 转诊进度同步'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="divider"></view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" open-type="getUserInfo" bindtap="onLogin">
      微信一键授权登录
    </button>

    <view class="mt-24">
      <view class="form-item">
        <view class="form-label">手机号绑定</view>
        <input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          maxlength="11"
          placeholder="请输入手机号（账号唯一）"
          value="{{phone}}"
          bindinput="onPhoneInput"
        />
      </view>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block mt-16" bindtap="bindPhone">绑定手机号</button>
      <view class="t-xs t-sub mt-8">
        * 企业主体可直接通过微信手机号快速验证组件获取；当前为手动绑定兜底。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="t-xs t-sub center">
    登录即代表同意《用户服务协议》与《隐私政策》
  </view>
</view>
